    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62344" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεκ-τέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέγω</span> B)
